  "hindi": "जिसने अश्व दधिक्रावन् का कीर्तन किया है, जब अग्नि प्रज्वलित हो और उषा का प्रकाश हो, उसे अदिति निर्दोष करे; वह मित्र और वरुण के साथ एकमत होकर रहे।",
  "english": "Whoever has celebrated the steed Dadhikrāvan, when Agni is kindled, at the dawning of the Dawn — may Aditi make him blameless; he in harmony with Mitra and with Varuṇa.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "akārīt (lit. 'has made/done') has no object; it is rendered 'has celebrated' as the usual sense with the genitive of the one praised. The edition prints varuṇenā with a long final vowel (metrical lengthening, not flagged). Aditi is the goddess of that name.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
